    <string name="accessibility_disclosure_title">Accessibility service use</string>
    <string name="accessibility_disclosure_message">DeskControl uses Accessibility Service to control apps on a connected external display. When enabled, it can identify the active app and window structure on that display. When you open or activate a control page, it may automatically focus the target window and, if needed, send a short focus-probe gesture. It then sends the touchpad or motion gestures, Back actions, and calibration key input that you initiate.\n\nActive app identifiers may appear temporarily in on-device diagnostics. Accessibility data is processed only on your device and is not sent to us or third parties.</string>
